<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section>
<div class="section-label"><span class="idx">01</span><span>request path, traced end to end</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
<p class="lede">One request, four inspection points — from the browser down to the infrastructure it lands on.</p>

<div class="flow">
<span class="scanline"></span>

<div class="flow-node">
<div class="badge">01</div>
<div class="label">Application</div>
<div class="sub">browser / client</div>
</div>
<div class="flow-connector"><span class="num">a</span></div>

<div class="flow-node">
<div class="badge">02</div>
<div class="label">API</div>
<div class="sub">/health · /login</div>
</div>
<div class="flow-connector"><span class="num">b</span></div>

<div class="flow-node">
<div class="badge">03</div>
<div class="label">Security Testing</div>
<div class="sub">SAST / DAST / SCA</div>
</div>
<div class="flow-connector"><span class="num">c</span></div>

<div class="flow-node">
<div class="badge">04</div>
<div class="label">Cloud / Infra</div>
<div class="sub">deployment target</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="callouts">
<div class="callout"><span class="n">a</span><p><strong>Client to API.</strong> Every request is unauthenticated until it reaches <span class="path" style="color:var(--line)">/login</span>.</p></div>
<div class="callout"><span class="n">b</span><p><strong>API to test surface.</strong> Endpoints are intentionally seeded with OWASP Top 10 findings for tools to catch.</p></div>
<div class="callout"><span class="n">c</span><p><strong>Findings to infra.</strong> Results trace back to where the vulnerable code actually runs.</p></div>
</div>
</section>

<section>
<div class="section-label"><span class="idx">02</span><span>endpoint schedule</span><span class="rule"></span></div>

<table class="spec">
<thead>
<tr><th>Path</th><th>Access</th><th>Description</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="path"><a href="/health" style="color:inherit; text-decoration:none;">/health</a></td>
<td><span class="access-tag public"><span class="sw"></span>public</span></td>
<td class="desc">Health check — no authentication required.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="path"><a href="/login" style="color:inherit; text-decoration:none;">/login</a></td>
<td><span class="access-tag auth"><span class="sw"></span>authenticate</span></td>
<td class="desc">Sign in via local authentication or SAML SSO.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="path"><a href="/security-lab" style="color:inherit; text-decoration:none;">/security-lab</a></td>
<td><span class="access-tag protected"><span class="sw"></span>protected</span></td>
<td class="desc">Vulnerability catalog. Requires an active session from /login.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</section>

